  "notes": [
    "[THIS PRODUCT] Powered by a 150-watt motor and holds a maximum grinding capacity of 2.1 ounces (60 grams).",
    "[THIS PRODUCT] Features an integrated cord storage compartment built directly into the bottom of the base.",
    "[THIS PRODUCT] Designed for a maximum continuous run time of 45 seconds, followed by a recommended 3-minute cool-down period to avoid overheating the motor.",
    "[GENERAL] Unlike burr grinders that crush beans through uniform mechanical settings, blade grinders chop beans with high-speed blades, meaning grind size is controlled entirely by run time (shorter for coarse, longer for fine).",
    "[GENERAL] Pulsing the power button in short bursts and gently shaking the grinder while operating helps circulate beans for a more even grind consistency."
